# House reference pieces (underscore-prefixed) are ours and must be tracked:
# the submit gate requires them, and a fresh clone could not pass without them.
!workspace/references/study/_*

# Harness autosaves are recovery copies, not work (the archive repo keeps them)
workspace/scratch/*.autosave.ans

